阿娜洛洁","text":"[show]原来如此，是这么一回事……[l]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_9"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"noOut":false,"mirrow":true,"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"addImg":"chara043_1_face_chara043_1c","trans":true,"noIn":false,"layer":"chara3","x":570,"transTime":300,"y":-119,"bright":0.6,"scaleY":1,"img":"chara043_1"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"options":[{"text":"你想到什么了吗？","tag":"tag_10"}]},"key":"option"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_10"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"noOut":false,"mirrow":true,"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"addImg":"chara043_1_face_chara043_1c","trans":true,"noIn":false,"layer":"chara3","x":570,"transTime":300,"y":-119,"bright":1,"scaleY":1,"img":"chara043_1"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"charaName":"阿娜洛洁","text":"[cm][show]还记得我之前说过，我对花草散发的气息很敏感吗？其实这本质上是感受大地之中的自然魔力。[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_11"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"charaName":"阿娜洛洁","text":"[show]在这附近发现花田的传言的确是空穴来风。我能在这里的泥土中感觉到古老的生机。[r]很久以前……这里毫无疑问，存在一片花田。[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_12"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"charaName":"阿娜洛洁","text":"[show]但如今这里的魔力非常紊乱。而且看这些冲积痕，天河早就流不到这里了。[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_13"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara1"},"key":"top"},{"para":{"img":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2e","layer":"chara1"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"noOut":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2e","trans":true,"noIn":false,"layer":"chara1","x":50,"transTime":300,"y":-180,"bright":1,"scaleY":1,"img":"chara002_2"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"noOut":false,"mirrow":true,"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"addImg":"chara043_1_face_chara043_1c","trans":true,"noIn":false,"layer":"chara3","x":570,"transTime":300,"y":-119,"bright":0.6,"scaleY":1,"img":"chara043_1"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"charaName":"米托拉","text":"[show]所以……你的意思是说，花田早就消失了……？[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_14"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara3"},"key":"top"},{"para":{"noOut":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2e","trans":true,"noIn":false,"layer":"chara1","x":50,"transTime":300,"y":-180,"bright":0.6,"scaleY":1,"img":"chara002_2"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"noOut":false,"mirrow":true,"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"addImg":"chara043_1_face_chara043_1c","trans":true,"noIn":false,"layer":"chara3","x":570,"transTime":300,"y":-119,"bright":1,"scaleY":1,"img":"chara043_1"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"charaName":"阿娜洛洁","text":"[show]没错。唉，还以为有钱赚呢，真是白跑了一趟。[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_15"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"noOut":false,"mirrow":true,"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"addImg":"chara043_1_face_chara043_1c","trans":true,"noIn":false,"layer":"chara3","x":570,"transTime":300,"y":-119,"bright":0.6,"scaleY":1,"img":"chara043_1"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"charaName":"“顺风”米莉","text":"[show]怎么会……那米莉就没办法给希瑟老师送上鲜花了吗……[l]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_16"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"options":[{"text":"米莉为什么这么执着呢？","tag":"tag_17"}]},"key":"option"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_17"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"charaName":"“顺风”米莉","text":"[cm][show]那是因为……[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_18"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"charaName":"“顺风”米莉","text":"[show]自从五年前……大人们说“异变”来了，爸爸妈妈就很少陪着米莉了。自卫团们告诉米莉说，外面越来越不安全……我们这些小孩子一直都没法出村。[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_19"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"charaName":"“顺风”米莉","text":"[show]我们每天只能聚在一起，呆呆地看着慢慢发黄的土墙。我们一直在幻想外面的世界是什么样子的……米莉才会去努力成为一名信使！[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_20"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"charaName":"“顺风”米莉","text":"[show]这几年……除了去给大家送信外，米莉唯一觉得快乐的时光，就是去上希瑟老师的课。老师每天都会告诉我们，外面的世界有多么宽广，是多么美丽……[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_21"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"charaName":"“顺风”米莉","text":"[show]米莉……最喜欢希瑟老师了。所以米莉也想……在希瑟老师不高兴的时候，想家的时候，也能安慰安慰她……告诉她，我们索利德也有美丽的鲜花……也还有我们陪着她……[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_22"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara1"},"key":"top"},{"para":{"noOut":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2e","trans":true,"noIn":false,"layer":"chara1","x":50,"transTime":300,"y":-180,"bright":1,"scaleY":1,"img":"chara002_2"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"charaName":"米托拉","text":"[show]是这样啊……[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_23"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara3"},"key":"top"},{"para":{"noOut":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2e","trans":true,"noIn":false,"layer":"chara1","x":50,"transTime":300,"y":-180,"bright":0.6,"scaleY":1,"img":"chara002_2"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"img":"chara043_1_face_chara043_1a","layer":"chara3"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"noOut":false,"mirrow":true,"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"addImg":"chara043_1_face_chara043_1a","trans":true,"noIn":false,"layer":"chara3","x":570,"transTime":300,"y":-119,"bright":1,"scaleY":1,"img":"chara043_1"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"charaName":"阿娜洛洁","text":"[show]这还不简单。[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_24"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"charaName":"","text":"[show]（阿娜洛洁将手插入土壤，轻轻捧起一株仙人球。）[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_25"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2c","layer":"chara1"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"noOut":false,"mirrow":true,"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"addImg":"chara043_1_face_chara043_1a","trans":true,"noIn":false,"layer":"chara3","x":570,"transTime":300,"y":-119,"bright":0.6,"scaleY":1,"img":"chara043_1"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"charaName":"“顺风”米莉","text":"[show]咦……？[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_26"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"noOut":false,"mirrow